flowchart TD
  accTitle: Reasoning plans; durable services execute.
  accDescr: Proposed Factory composition on T3 V2: models propose plans; durable services validate transitions and run accepted work. Task dependencies are distinct from execution lineage. V2 means the existing command/event/outbox engine. Peer discussion does not change ownership or acceptance; typed service commands do.
  ux --> coord
  coord --> commands
  commands --> v2
  v2 --> tasks
  v2 --> context
  v2 --> messages
  tasks --> adapters
  context --> adapters
  messages --> adapters
  adapters --> results
  ux["Shared thread / plan / artifacts"]
  coord["Coordinator proposes work"]
  commands["Plan + task service commands"]
  v2["V2 events / receipts / outbox"]
  tasks["Task attempts + claims"]
  context["Context + evidence references"]
  messages["Scoped peer messages"]
  adapters["Existing harness adapters"]
  results["Results back to goal thread"]
